  "title": "Cold Furnace",
  "briefing": "Contingency Zero has lit the Forgemaster on Cairn, and the furnaces are cold. Metal first: extractors on every deposit you can reach, then power, then a factory to start turning ore into armour. A Lattice listening camp sits on the far side of the proving grounds, and its fast raiders will probe you. Put a turret in their path.",
