  "messages": [
    "Forgemaster awake. The furnaces want metal: Metal Extractors on the glowing deposits.",
    "Then power. Solar Collectors burn steady; Wind Turbines are cheap and moody.",
    "Ore flowing. Raise a factory. A Vehicle Plant makes Anvils.",
    "Factory hot. Anvils are slow, but they do not break.",
    "Turret up. Let them come to it.",
    "Listening camp scrapped. Their eyes are out.",
    "Lattice scouts, fast and fragile. Swat them.",
    "Striders inbound. They hit and run: make them stay.",
    "Big raid with artillery behind it. Go for the gun.",
    "Scouts scrapped.",
    "Striders broken.",
    "Third raid crushed. The Lattice is learning.",
    "The furnaces are lit. Let the Lattice listen to that."
  ],
